{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And the favor of Him who dwelt in the bush.</b> And also the favor of El who was revealed in the bush, in which He indicated the matter of עִמּוֹ אָנֹכִי בְצָרָה (Psalms 91:15). All these shall come upon the head of Joseph — besides the blessings that come upon his head together with the congregation from the Elohim of the heights, who blesses without intermediary." "<b>And for the crown of the head of his brothers.</b> For he is indeed worthy of this, for he was indeed possessed of a nezer and crown of kingship among his brothers, and conducted himself toward all of them with piety."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:23:35.716791329Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}